# Student Attendance Register App

An Android application developed in Kotlin to manage and monitor daily student attendance. Built as part of a collaborative academic assignment.

---

## Features

- **Add Students**: Dynamically input student names and append them to an interactive class register list.
- **Mark Attendance**: Toggle student status between **Present** and **Absent** in real time with intuitive color feedback (green for present, red for absent).
- **Live Summary Counters**: Automatically recalculates and displays the **Total Students**, **Present Count**, and **Absent Count** whenever records update.
- **Empty State Notification**: Displays a placeholder message when no student entries exist.
- **Reset Register**: Clears all records with an `AlertDialog` confirmation prompt to avoid accidental deletion.

---

## Tech Stack & Architecture

- **Language**: Kotlin
- **IDE**: Android Studio
- **UI Components**: LinearLayout, ListView, EditText, Button, TextView, AlertDialog
- **Adapter**: Custom `BaseAdapter` (`StudentAdapter`) with dynamic view recycling and UI callbacks
- **Version Control**: Git & GitHub

